<p>Your blade drinks in death. Whenever you score a kill with this talent off cooldown, your next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> melee attacks within 6 turns will always critically strike, and you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 20%, 24%, 27%, 30%</acronym> critical multiplier for the duration.</p><p>Additionally, you gain an extra <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> vim per kill.</p>